T1  - Advanced pubertal growth spurt in subjects born preterm: the Helsinki study of very low birth weight adults.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1210/jc.2010-1523
A1  - Wehkalampi, Karoliina
A1  - Hovi, Petteri
A1  - Dunkel, Leo
A1  - Strang-Karlsson, Sonja
