T1  - Fibroscan: a new noninvasive method for evaluation of liver dysfunction in Turner syndrome.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1111/j.1365-2362.2010.02397.x
A1  - Messina, Maria Francesca
A1  - Squadrito, Giovanni
