T1  - The relationship between the age of onset of type 1 diabetes and the subsequent development of a severe eating disorder by female patients.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1111/j.1399-5448.2010.00708.x
A1  - Takii, Masato
A1  - Uchigata, Yasuko
A1  - Kishimoto, Junji
