T1  - Endocrine dysfunction following traumatic brain injury in children.
T3  - Comment in: J Pediatr. 2010 Dec;157(6):873-5<ovid:br/> PMID: 20888010 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/20888010]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.jpeds.2010.07.004
A1  - Kaulfers, Anne-Marie D
