T1  - The role of estrogen receptor alpha in growth plate cartilage for longitudinal bone growth.
T3  - Erratum in: J Bone Miner Res. 2011 Feb;26(2):439
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1002/jbmr.156
A1  - Borjesson, Anna E
A1  - Lagerquist, Marie K
A1  - Liu, Chen
A1  - Shao, Ruijin
A1  - Windahl, Sara H
A1  - Karlsson, Camilla
A1  - Sjogren, Klara
A1  - Moverare-Skrtic, Sofia
