T1  - Association between physical activity and cardiovascular risk in Chinese youth independent of age and pubertal stage.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/1471-2458-10-303
A1  - Kong, Alice P S
A1  - Choi, Kai-Chow
A1  - Li, Albert M C
