T1  - Parity and risk of hemorrhagic strokes.
T3  - Comment in: Neurology. 2010 May 4;74(18):1408-9<ovid:br/> PMID: 20335559 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/20335559]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1212/WNL.0b013e3181dc13a5
A1  - Jung, Sun-Young
A1  - Bae, Hee-Joon
A1  - Park, Byung-Joo
A1  - Yoon, Byung-Woo
A2  - Yoon BW, Lee SH, Han DH, Kim JS, Kwon Y, Kim GK, Kim YS, Park BJ, Lee SM, Kim JS, Han MK, Bae HJ, Lee SP, Lee SH, Hong SC, Jung DK, Yim MB, Yoo KM, Jeon BC, Choi CH, Kim EK, Hong KS, Whang CJ, Kim JS, Rim HJ, Hwang SY, Kim JM, Kim EY, Kim WK, Lee BC, Yu KH, Ahn SK, Kim HS, Lee YS, Chung YS, Kyo SE, Cho KH, Kim TS, Kim JH, Choi SM, Huh IH, Jeong SW
