T1  - Thyroid function in obese children and adolescents.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1159/000284361
A1  - Marras, Valeria
A1  - Casini, Maria Rosaria
A1  - Pilia, Sabrina
A1  - Carta, Daniela
