T1  - Sex hormones, insulin resistance and high-density lipoprotein cholesterol levels in children.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1159/000284357
A1  - Agirbasli, Mehmet
A1  - Agaoglu, Nihat Bugra
A1  - Orak, Nilay
