T1  - Initial insulin therapy in children and adolescents with type 1 diabetes mellitus.
T3  - Erratum in: Pediatr Diabetes. 2010 Nov;11(7):509 Note: Weitzela, Dieter [corrected to Weitzel, Dieter]; Pfeffera, Ulla [corrected to Pfeffer, Ulla]; Herbstc, Antje [corrected to Herbst, Antje]
