T1  - Height growth velocity, islet autoimmunity and type 1 diabetes development: the Diabetes Autoimmunity Study in the Young.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1007/s00125-009-1428-2
A1  - Lamb, M M
A1  - Yin, X
