T1  - [Association between insulin-like growth factor-1 receptor gene polymorphisms and with susceptibility to adolescent idiopathic scoliosis].
A1  - Liu, Wen-jun
A1  - Qiu, Yong
A1  - Chen, Zhi-jun
A1  - Liu, Zhen
A1  - Shu, Hao
