T1  - New definition for the partial remission period in children and adolescents with type 1 diabetes.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.2337/dc08-1987
A1  - Mortensen, Henrik B
A1  - Hougaard, Philip
A1  - Swift, Peter
A1  - Hansen, Lars
