T1  - Elevated coagulation and inflammatory markers in adolescents with a history of premature adrenarche.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.metabol.2008.12.002
A1  - Livadas, Sarantis
A1  - Dracopoulou, Maria
A1  - Vasileiadi, Karmen
A1  - Lazaropoulou, Christina
A1  - Magiakou, Maria-Alexandra
