T1  - Distribution of adiponectin, leptin, and metabolic correlates of insulin resistance: a longitudinal study in British children; 1: Prepuberty (EarlyBird 15).
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1373/clinchem.2008.103499
A1  - Murphy, Michael J
A1  - Hosking, Jo
