T1  - Age of menarche and the metabolic syndrome in China.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1097/EDE.0b013e3181567faf
A1  - Heys, Michelle
A1  - Schooling, C Mary
A1  - Jiang, Chaoqiang
