T1  - Final height in patients with idiopathic short stature and high growth hormone responses to stimulation tests.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1159/000097512
A1  - Martinelli, Carlos Eduardo
A1  - Sader Milani, Soraya
A1  - Previato, Joana Karin
