T1  - Abnormal myocardial deformation properties in obese, non-hypertensive children: an ambulatory blood pressure monitoring, standard echocardiographic, and strain rate imaging study.
T3  - Comment in: Eur Heart J. 2007 Mar;28(5):638; author reply 638-9<ovid:br/> PMID: 17298970 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/17298970]<ovid:br/> <ovid:br/>Comment in: Eur Heart J. 2007 Jul;28(13):1662-3; author reply 1663<ovid:br/> PMID: 17483534 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/17483534]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1093/eurheartj/ehl163
A1  - Di Salvo, Giovanni
A1  - Pacileo, Giuseppe
A1  - Del Giudice, Emanuele Miraglia
A1  - Natale, Francesco
