T1  - Retinal vascular caliber and risk of retinopathy in young patients with type 1 diabetes.
T3  - Comment in: Ophthalmology. 2007 Sep;114(9):1796-7; author reply 1797<ovid:br/> PMID: 17822996 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/17822996]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.ophtha.2006.05.009
A1  - Alibrahim, Ekaterina
