T1  - [Cardiovascular risk and metabolic profile in obese children and adolescents with low insulin sensitivity].
T2  - Perfil metabolico de riesgo cardiovascular en ninos y adolescentes obesos con menor sensibilidad insulinica.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.4067/s0034-98872005000700007
A1  - Burrows, Raquel
