T1  - Longitudinal evaluation and risk factors of lipodystrophy and associated metabolic changes in HIV-infected children.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1097/01.qai.0000178930.93033.f2
A1  - Beregszaszi, Marta
A1  - Dollfus, Catherine
A1  - Levine, Martine
A1  - Faye, Albert
A1  - Deghmoun, Samia
A1  - Bellal, Nassima
