T1  - Association of aromatase (CYP 19) gene variation with features of hyperandrogenism in two populations of young women.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1093/humrep/deh900
A1  - Petry, C J
A1  - Ong, K K
A1  - Michelmore, K F
A1  - Artigas, S
