T1  - Insulin management and metabolic control of type 1 diabetes mellitus in childhood and adolescence in 18 countries. Hvidore Study Group on Childhood Diabetes.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1002/(SICI)1096-9136(199809)15:9<752::AID-DIA678>3.0.CO;2-W
A1  - Mortensen, H B
A1  - Robertson, K J
A1  - Aanstoot, H J
A1  - Danne, T
A1  - Holl, R W
A1  - Hougaard, P
A1  - Atchison, J A
A1  - Chiarelli, F
A1  - Daneman, D
A1  - Dinesen, B
A1  - Dorchy, H
A1  - Garandeau, P
A1  - Greene, S
A1  - Hoey, H
A1  - Kaprio, E A
A1  - Kocova, M
A1  - Martul, P
A1  - Matsuura, N
A1  - Schoenle, E J
