T1  - Male predominance of type 1 (insulin-dependent) diabetes mellitus in young adults: results from a 5-year prospective nationwide study of the 15-34-year age group in Sweden.
T3  - Erratum in: Diabetologia 1992 Mar;35(3):296
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1007/BF00400852
