T1  - Risk of developing insulin-dependent diabetes mellitus (IDDM) before 35 years of age: indications of climatological determinants for age at onset.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1093/ije/21.2.352
A1  - Nystrom, L
A1  - Dahlquist, G
A1  - Ostman, J
